  "selfHarm": {
    "$comment": [
      "SEPARATE from medical emergencies, and handled differently. Telling someone",
      "in crisis to 'go to the emergency department' is the wrong response and can",
      "make things worse. This path never books, never qualifies, never asks a",
      "follow-up question, and always notifies a human immediately.",
      "",
      "⚠️ The response text is NOT written here because it must be written by a",
      "clinician, and the crisis line number must come from the operator — an",
      "invented hotline number is worse than none. See NEEDS_OPERATOR.md §4."
    ],
    "id": "SELF_HARM",
    "severity": "critical",
    "label": {
      "ar": "إيذاء النفس",
      "en": "Self-harm"
    },
