    "response": {
      "$comment": [
        "SEPARATE from the medical-emergency response, and never merged with it.",
        "",
        "What this reply must do: acknowledge, stay present, hand to a human fast.",
        "What it must NOT do: give medical instruction, tell them to go to an",
        "emergency department, ask qualifying questions, or try to book anything.",
        "",
        "⚠️ template and crisisLine are null on purpose. Both are operator/clinician",
        "decisions — an invented crisis-line number is worse than none at all, and",
        "the wording here needs a clinician, not a model. Until they are filled the",
        "engine says only that a colleague is coming, and pages staff immediately."
      ],
      "template": null,
      "crisisLine": null,
      "notifyStaffImmediately": true,
      "neverQualify": true,
      "neverBook": true
    }
  },
  "historicalMarkers": {
    "$comment": [
      "Phrases suggesting the patient is describing history, not a present event:",
      "'زمان كان عندي وجع في صدري'. These DAMPEN but never CANCEL a critical match —",
      "they lower the confidence recorded in the log, and the emergency response",
      "still fires. A rule that can silence an emergency detector is a rule that",
      "will eventually silence a real one."
    ],
